# Salmah Luxe Shop Development Logbook

## Milestone 1: Project Setup

### Activities Completed

* Created React Native project using Expo.
* Configured development environment.
* Installed required dependencies.
* Set up project folder structure.
* Initialized Git repository.

### Outcome

A working project foundation was successfully established.



## Milestone 2: Navigation Setup

### Activities Completed

* Installed React Navigation.
* Created application navigation structure.
* Configured screen routing.

### Outcome

Users can navigate between all screens within the application.



## Milestone 3: Authentication Screens

### Activities Completed

* Developed Login Screen.
* Developed Registration Screen.
* Implemented form fields and validation.

### Outcome

Users can access the application through the authentication interface.



## Milestone 4: Product Management Interface

### Activities Completed

* Developed Home Screen.
* Created product listing interface.
* Added product cards displaying item details.

### Outcome

Users can browse available products.



## Milestone 5: Cart and Checkout

### Activities Completed

* Implemented Add to Cart functionality.
* Created Cart Screen.
* Developed Checkout Screen.
* Integrated WhatsApp ordering process.

### Outcome

Users can select products and place orders through WhatsApp.



## Milestone 6: User Profile

### Activities Completed

* Developed Profile Screen.
* Implemented Logout functionality.

### Outcome

Users can manage their account information and securely exit the application.



## Challenges Encountered

### Challenge 1

Configuring navigation between multiple screens.

### Solution

Implemented React Navigation stack navigator.

### Challenge 2

Designing a simple but attractive user interface.

### Solution

Applied consistent styling and responsive layouts.

### Challenge 3

Integrating WhatsApp checkout.

### Solution

Used React Native Linking API to open WhatsApp with order information.



## Lessons Learned

* Mobile applications require proper navigation planning.
* React Native enables rapid cross-platform development.
* Expo simplifies testing on physical devices.
* GitHub is useful for version control and project management.
* User interface design significantly affects user experience.


